<title>USA: LoJack Corp Q4 Feb 29 net income slips.</title>
<headline>LoJack Corp Q4 Feb 29 net income slips.</headline>
<dateline>DEDHAM, Mass. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months Ended	 12 Months Ended</p>
<p>		     Last Day of February  Last Day of February</p>
<p>			1997	 1996	   1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenues  $15,618,000 $13,593,000  $61,665,000   $52,516,000</p>
<p> Oper Income 2,918,000   2,630,000   11,920,000     8,606,000</p>
<p> PreTax Inc  3,203,000   3,089,000   13,404,000    10,047,000</p>
<p> Tax	  (1,247,000)  2,463,000A  (5,224,000)    1,931,000A</p>
<p> Net Income  1,956,000   5,552,000A   8,180,000    11,978,000A</p>
<p> Per Share	   .09	   .24A	   .36	     .51A</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs 21,398,402 23,259,154  22,569,179   23,284,684</p>
<p>NOTE A: Includes non-recurring income tax credit of $2,654,000.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income for the fourth quarter of fiscal 1996 would have been $1,884,000 or $.08 per share had taxes been calculated at the fully taxed rate of 39 percent.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income for fiscal 1996 would have been $6,129,000 or $.26 per share had taxes been calculated at the fully taxed rate of 39 percent.</p>
</text>
